  "description": "Strand-line scatter along local Z (2.4 by 0.7 m): spiral shells, cowries, clam valves, white coral rubble and olive-brown seaweed wrack lying on the sand. One strip material; static. Flush-face fix: inner skin radius r - thickness -> r - max(thickness, .002) so zero-thickness bowls get a 2 mm inner skin instead of a coincident one (no rim triangles added); strip height y .006 -> .006 + i*.0006 so overlapping strips stack at distinct heights (max 6.6 mm).",
